  {
   "id": "morsels-314931@4",
   "gameId": "morsels-314931",
   "displayName": "Patch 4",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-01-26T22:50:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi folks - we’ve just pushed out a new update with some nice changes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changes in v0.34.0",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Morsels is now finally available for Macs! Iggy and I have actually been making the game on Macs this whole time so it will be interesting for us to finally get to play it…",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A balance/polish pass on many of the game’s bosses, more different at different difficulty levels.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many lovely new sound effects made by Sam added to the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A lot of work done on performance improvements that should have the game running more smoothly than before. We had a lot of help on this from our colleagues at 24 Bit Games, who have also been handling console porting, AND also sent me this beautiful woolly Fatberg who I love.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Eel shop encounter re-added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ironed out some minor bugs related to Lidsel.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug fix: shard data not stored properly when changing save slots.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug fix: bad dog could get the player stuck behind trenches.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug fix: shortcut tunnel sometimes caused crash.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45171971/6e486d1daa37e9298081a6d9afb2435b61c76186.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Toby",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
