  {
   "id": "morsels-314931@3",
   "gameId": "morsels-314931",
   "displayName": "Patch 3",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-12-13T01:20:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi folks,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new patch is now ready to download, featuring a mysterious new playable morsel, Lidsel, and a shortcut tunnel that makes it so that you don’t necessarily always have to start every run from level 1, depending on your progress in the previous run. Also, a bunch of little bug fixes etc. I hope you’ll enjoy it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changes in v0.33.4",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New morsel - Lidsel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Shortcut tunnel feature",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A couple of simple new items",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix: wishbone/Gosel items triggering when replacing cards",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix: Uggsel sometimes can't pick up its ball",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "On the dev team, we’re looking forward to taking a little break for the holidays and recharging our creative batteries. Hope you all have a lovely end to the year, and see you in January!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Toby",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
